### Upstream Attribution and Component Notice

This project is an open-source extension for the Omarchy Linux desktop environment.
Portions of this software are derived from the upstream Omarchy clipboard plugin
(https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy), licensed under the MIT License.

- **Upstream Omarchy Components:**
  - Base clipboard overlay UI structure (`Clipboard.qml`)
  - Wayland clipboard event listener and media extraction (`capture.sh`)
  - History serialization, URI normalization, and list filtering (`ClipboardHistory.js`)

- **New Additions & Modifications (by Ronak Yadav):**
  - Bulk / sequential paste execution engine (`bulk_paste.py`)
  - Chronological batch selection and count validation algorithms (`ClipboardHistory.js`)
  - Bulk paste UI toolbar, number selector, and status reporting (`Clipboard.qml`)
  - Wayland client focus tracking, restoration, and terminal detection
  - Multi-image and mixed-media sequential replay pipeline
  - Automated unit and desktop integration test suites (`tests/`)
